### Get all medicines with optional filters and pagination
GET http://localhost:8030/medicines?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### Get all medicines with search filter
GET http://localhost:8030/medicines?search=ci&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### Get all medicines with status filter
GET http://localhost:8030/medicines?status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### Get all medicines with type filter
GET http://localhost:8030/medicines?type=TABLET&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### Get all medicines with group filter
GET http://localhost:8030/medicines?groupId=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### Get all medicines with multiple filters
GET http://localhost:8030/medicines?search=aspirin&status=ACTIVE&type=TABLET&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

###